if;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9188335650/original/2kddh2V0NKYmGKwA4Mvv0R55s_Xzp8RzCg.png?1686137778\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9188335650\"></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 107%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 107%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\">Once it has been done, a user is able to drag across relevant tags, add or delete signatories and review the document.</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 107%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"margin-bottom: 8pt; margin-left: 0cm; line-height: 107%; font-size: 16px; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/cdn.freshdesk.com/data/helpdesk/attachments/production/9185235054/original/J2iDY9wfVfK_p4l9TqVY3OjFrQ2xcog1eQ.png?1682432104\" style=\"width: auto;\" class=\"fr-fic fr-fil fr-dib\" data-attachment=\"[object Object]\" data-id=\"9185235054\"></p><p><br></p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px;\">Once performed, a user is able to add a message to Signatories, set reminders and send a document to a client.</p><p dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 14px;\">&nbsp;</p><p><span dir=\"ltr\" style=\"font-size: 16px; line-height: 107%; font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;\"></span></p><p dir=\"ltr\">&nbsp;</p>&nbsp;<p><br></p>\n\t</article>\n\n\t<hr />\t\n\t\t\n\n\t\t<p class=\"article-vote\" id=\"voting-container\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-user-id=\"\" \n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-article-id=\"9000225368\"\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tdata-language=\"en\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tDid you find it helpful?<span data-href=\"/support/solutions/articles/9000225368/thumbs_up\